(f) remove or alter this license or any copyright notice;
(g) use the Project, its content or its code to train AI/ML models.

4. WHY CLONING THIS PROJECT WILL NOT HELP YOU

The repository is intentionally not a ready-to-run copy of the live
business. Even if you clone it, it will not work as a finished product
for you:

- Private files are not included: environment files (.env), API keys,
  Firebase and database credentials, service accounts and admin setup.
- Image and brand assets (the assets folder) are not included.
- The site depends on the owner's own accounts and services (Groq API
  key, Firebase project, Firestore rules, admin UID list). None of these
  are shared, and you would have to create your own.
- All branding, text, team data, projects, pricing and contact details
  belong to the owner and describe the owner's business. You would have
  to replace every one of them, at which point you are building your own
  project, not using this one.
- Using it as-is, or with only light edits, would break Section 3 and
  would be unlawful.

In short: you would have to change nearly everything, and you are not
permitted to use the Project for your own purposes anyway.

